<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lowe's Cos cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lowe's Cos cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it downgraded Lowe's Cos Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- said cut the 1997 earnings estimate to $1.90 a share from $2.00 a share.</p>
<p>-- Lowe's lost 1/2 to 33-3/8 in midday trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
